'''Tip of the Beast's Tongue''' is the only stage in '''Affliction in the Forest II''', which appears after clearing [[Deep Jungle Area 10]]. It drops no items, but unlocks stages 11-16 of [[Hidden Forest of Gapra]] when cleared. It was added in [[Version 12.1 Update|Version 12.1]]. [[Vermilingua Rangmaster]] debuts here. This is a [[No Continues]] stage.

